    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605\u2605The following fixes have been made in the demo version, please update to the latest version.\u2605\u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cfText is garbled.<br>\u25cfCan't jump sometimes.</strong><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>&quot;Magical Girl Critical DELUXE&quot;</strong> is a remake of the well-received action game as a smartphone app, combined with a sequel that was frozen in development due to circumstances, with all the graphics refined and new elements added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can do &quot;move&quot; &quot;jump&quot; &quot;avoid&quot; &quot;attack&quot; &quot;magic&quot;+\u03b1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires &quot;Critical Thinking&quot; instead of &quot;Technique&quot; or &quot;Reflexes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By learning new magic and updating your character's abilities, you can expand your range of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, explore every corner of the stage, and collect items to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, the story of the second round will unfold and the system will become a run-and-jump game, offering a new game experience in a different stage from the first round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play over and over again with challenging elements like Clear Ranks and Time Attack for boss rush stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the magical girl's destiny unfold in a world of nostalgic pixel art and sound.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605\u2605The following fixes have been made in the demo version, please update to the latest version.\u2605\u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cfText is garbled.<br>\u25cfCan't jump sometimes.</strong><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>&quot;Magical Girl Critical DELUXE&quot;</strong> is a remake of the well-received action game as a smartphone app, combined with a sequel that was frozen in development due to circumstances, with all the graphics refined and new elements added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can do &quot;move&quot; &quot;jump&quot; &quot;avoid&quot; &quot;attack&quot; &quot;magic&quot;+\u03b1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It requires &quot;Critical Thinking&quot; instead of &quot;Technique&quot; or &quot;Reflexes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By learning new magic and updating your character's abilities, you can expand your range of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, explore every corner of the stage, and collect items to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game, the story of the second round will unfold and the system will become a run-and-jump game, offering a new game experience in a different stage from the first round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play over and over again with challenging elements like Clear Ranks and Time Attack for boss rush stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the magical girl's destiny unfold in a world of nostalgic pixel art and sound.</p>",
